{"game": "repo", "language": "english", "appid": 3241660, "month": "2025-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1763856000, "end_date": 1764547199, "month_true_total": 22301, "quota": 48, "returned": 48, "pulled_at": "2026-10-05 12:53:41 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "212196754", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006473131", "personaname": "Kiki Sohma", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006473131/", "num_games_owned": 592, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 22130, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 196, "playtime_at_review": 13321, "last_played": 1791146490, "avatar": "93486ff21336489c3ec2dcc00ba1bec681627499"}, "language": "english", "review": "A very fun game with friends or a very challenging game solo.\n\nGot competent friends? \nYou will have fun making it through increasingly challenging levels, getting upgrades, buying weapons and shooting the enemies that annoy you.\n\nGot incompetent friends?\nYou will have fun running each other over with the cart, accidently smacking each other with items, falling into (or being knocked into) deadly pits, and getting killed by an enemy because the friends alerted a monster. Plus, when you all inevitably die, you can have fun killing each other to win a crown to wear for the next attempt. All while laughing your Semibot head off.\n\nIt is really fun and challenging and makes the looter multiplayer genre fun again. \nCreators of the game are very active and creating new stuff and fixing bugs.\nNewest big update increased the replay value a ton.", "timestamp_created": 1764547135, "timestamp_updated": 1764547135, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "212196569", "author": {"